      "widgets_values": [
        "Image 1: East Asian, 22 years old, woman, long dark-brown wavy hair past the shoulders, clear luminous skin, a small dark beauty mark on her left cheek, thin gold hoop earrings, cream ribbed-knit cropped long-sleeve top, high-waisted light-blue denim jeans, warm unguarded aura, photorealistic natural texture. Image 1 provides the woman's face, hair and clothing for the whole clip.\n\nAmusement park carousel at night, foreground the carved painted horses and brass poles sweeping past the lens, midground the woman riding, background the ride's mirrored centre column and hundreds of small warm bulbs against black night; camera axis riding with her on the turning platform, fixed relative to her; Figure 1 holds the centre of the frame in medium shot on the horse. Medium shot from the front, locked to the platform about 15%, the world turning behind at speed; she rides the rising and falling horse with one hand high on the brass pole, grin fixed (Chubbuck: unembarrassed delight). Cut — next shot: close-up just off her cheek, slow push-in about 30%, bulb light sweeping across her face in a warm pulse as she leans into the turn with her hair swinging wide. Figure 1 (excited, quick, slightly breathless voice): \"이거 어릴 때 이후로 처음 타요.\" Cut — next shot: medium shot, the ride slowing, slow pull-back about 35%, the streaking bulbs resolving back into points as she settles onto the saddle and looks into the lens still laughing. A mechanical carousel organ playing a bright looping waltz, the deep rumble of the platform bearing, the creak of the pole, distant park crowd, her laughter close in."
